(
    title: "Atlantis II",
    developer: Some("Dennis Koble"),
    description: Some("The rare \"contest\" edition of Atlantis, awarded to top scorers in Imagic\'s Lost City of Atlantis competition. The city\'s defence plays like the original — three ground batteries against waves of Gorgons — but the raiders are far faster and the scoring is retuned, making it a punishing test rather than the retail game\'s gentler one. Very few cartridges were made, and it is among the most sought-after Atari 2600 releases."),
